[ar:邹晔Ganny]
[ti:The Dance of Samsara (轮回之舞)]
[by:netease]
[00:00.00]作词 : 邹晔Ganny
[00:00.41]作曲 : 邹晔Ganny
[00:00.81]编曲 : 邹晔Ganny
[00:01.22]Particles dance in a beam of light,
[00:06.27]Tides pull away, then return to the height.
[00:11.51]Every beginning you think is done,
[00:16.67]Is waiting there where it first begun.
[00:22.22]Round and round the pattern bends,
[00:27.36]Nothing escapes, nothing ends.
[00:31.67]When the last star cools and turns to rust,
[00:37.11]The dance begins again from dust.
[01:04.29]Seasons may fade, mountains may wear,
[01:09.30]But every note still hangs in the air.
[01:14.78]The path you took, the choice you made,
[01:20.16]Echoes forever, never swayed.
[01:25.33]Round and round the pattern bends,
[01:30.63]Nothing escapes, nothing ends.
[01:34.92]When the last star cools and turns to rust,
[01:40.44]The dance begins again from dust.
[01:46.48]Time is a circle we cannot see,
[01:51.74]A promise written in gravity.
[01:57.07]No true departure, no final line,
[02:02.27]In the long run, all paths realign.
[02:07.53]Round and round the pattern bends,
[02:12.69]Nothing escapes, nothing ends.
[02:17.11]When the last star cools and turns to rust,
[02:22.67]The dance begins again from dust.
